### Home Route
GET http://localhost:8080/

### ==========================
### BOOKS
### ==========================

### Get All Books
GET http://localhost:8080/books

### Get Book By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/books/REPLACE_BOOK_ID

### Create Book
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "genre": "Classic",
  "publishedYear": 1925,
  "publisher": "Scribner",
  "pages": 180,
  "available": true
}

### Update Book
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/REPLACE_BOOK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby (Updated)",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "genre": "Classic",
  "publishedYear": 1925,
  "publisher": "Charles Scribner's Sons",
  "pages": 200,
  "available": false
}

### Delete Book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/REPLACE_BOOK_ID

### ==========================
### TEAMS
### ==========================

### Get All Teams
GET http://localhost:8080/teams

### Get Team By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/teams/REPLACE_TEAM_ID

### Create Team
POST http://localhost:8080/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Development Team",
  "department": "IT",
  "leader": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "members": 8
}

### Update Team
PUT http://localhost:8080/teams/REPLACE_TEAM_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Backend Team",
  "department": "Software Development",
  "leader": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "members": 10
}

### Delete Team
DELETE http://localhost:8080/teams/REPLACE_TEAM_ID